 "notes": {
  "source_inference": "chat rows carry no metadata; source is inferred from image paths (EvalMuse/PAL4VST/COCO) and prompt schema (channels\u2192RichHF, multi-image\u2192ImagenWorld edit); core-flat-single = single-image dual-axis rows (ImagenWorld TIG et al.)",
  "evalmuse_provenance": "EvalMuse score-only booster rows are appended from the inspector_data_em corpus by bash_scripts/finish_clean_data.sh; viescore2/build_evalmuse_aug.py regenerates those rows byte-identically (and the 384^2-area LANCZOS-capped images pixel-identically) from the official EvalMuse-40K annotations (HF DY-Evalab/EvalMuse) under manifests/evalmuse_aug_ids.json + evalmuse_aug_system_prompt.txt; target = round((mean(total_score)-1)*2.5). Gap closed 2026-08-08."
 }
